{"id":"n62811-3-10","stage":3,"title":"그룹 · 组合","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n62811-3-10-1","ko":"넌 어떤 가수를 좋아하니?","zh":"你喜欢哪位歌手呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"넌","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가수를","meaning":"歌手","explanation":"가수：歌手；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"가수","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62256","senseId":"1","lemma":"가수","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋아하니?","meaning":"喜欢","explanation":"좋아하다：喜欢；니：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"좋아하다","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27929","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋아하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"9e173c93773cc558","term":"가수","zh":"歌手","audio":"/audio/9e173c93773cc5589668.mp3","entryId":"62256","definition":"以唱歌为职业的人。","pronunciation":["가수"]},{"id":"74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c","term":"좋아하다","zh":"喜欢","audio":"/audio/74a6aa2fc6ae8f0c6bc1.mp3","entryId":"27929","definition":"对某事抱有好感。","pronunciation":["조ː아하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4e8389a915b0e7d7f0ec.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n62811-3-10-2","ko":"요즘 활동하는 아홉 명으로 된 여성 그룹이 좋더라.","zh":"我最近挺喜欢由九名成员组成的女子组合的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요즘","meaning":"最近，近来，这阵子","explanation":"요즘：最近，近来，这阵子","readings":[{"term":"요즘","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20250","senseId":"1","lemma":"요즘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"활동하는","meaning":"活动，活跃","explanation":"활동하다：活动，活跃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"활동하다","audio":"/audio/71c4ca611fccb4fbcbdf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62340","senseId":"2","lemma":"활동하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아홉","meaning":"九","explanation":"아홉：九","readings":[{"term":"아홉","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29609","senseId":"1","lemma":"아홉","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"명으로","meaning":"个，名","explanation":"명：个，名；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"명","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70812","senseId":"1","lemma":"명","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"된","meaning":"分为，组成","explanation":"되다：分为，组成；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"10","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여성","meaning":"女性","explanation":"여성：女性","readings":[{"term":"여성","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67727","senseId":"1","lemma":"여성","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그룹이","meaning":"组合","explanation":"그룹：组合；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"그룹","audio":"/audio/5d908dddbd3ade6c7423.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62811","senseId":"3","lemma":"그룹","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋더라.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；더라：回顾并告诉对方亲身观察到的情况，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"828c4030dd68aa7b","term":"요즘","zh":"最近，近来，这阵子","audio":"/audio/828c4030dd68aa7bc886.mp3","entryId":"20250","definition":"从非常近的过去到现在之间。","pronunciation":["요즘"]},{"id":"71c4ca611fccb4fb","term":"활동하다","zh":"活动，活跃","audio":"/audio/71c4ca611fccb4fbcbdf.mp3","entryId":"62340","definition":"做某事。","pronunciation":["활똥하다"]},{"id":"20ed618de39e3d7d","term":"아홉","zh":"九","audio":"/audio/20ed618de39e3d7de102.mp3","entryId":"29609","definition":"八加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["아홉"]},{"id":"9f96b8e22cc06bfa","term":"명","zh":"个，名","audio":"/audio/9f96b8e22cc06bfafc54.mp3","entryId":"70812","definition":"计算人数的数量单位。","pronunciation":["명"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"分为，组成","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"以某个形态或结构组合而成。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"f414772fbd2cdd33","term":"여성","zh":"女性","audio":"/audio/f414772fbd2cdd331d09.mp3","entryId":"67727","definition":"成年后可生育孩子的女子。","pronunciation":["여성"]},{"id":"5d908dddbd3ade6c","term":"그룹","zh":"组合","audio":"/audio/5d908dddbd3ade6c7423.mp3","entryId":"62811","definition":"许多音乐家或歌手聚集到一起举办音乐活动的团体。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/5236ff74d18554959076.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=62811","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.6997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["你喜欢哪位歌手呢？","我最近挺喜欢由九名成员组成的女子组合的。","当然了，女生用粉色，男生用蓝色啦。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["你喜欢哪位歌手呢？","我最近挺喜欢由九名成员组成的女子组合的。","当然了，女生用粉色，男生用蓝色啦。"],"answer":1}]}
